          "role": "text",
          "text": "Bay Minette, September 20th, 1901.\n\nThe Board met in regular session, all members present.\n\nOn motion of Mr. Sessions, duly seconded, it was ordered that the\nfollowing books be, and the same are hereby, adopted for use in the\npublic schools of this county for the term of five years:\n\n    1.  Frye's Elements of Geography ....... Ginn & Co.\n    2.  Baldwin's Third Reader ............. American Book Co.\n\nThe Superintendent was directed to notify the several trustees, and\nto procure the said books at the contract price.",
